d/docker-calibre/compare/v9.17.0-ls5...v9.17.0-ls6","upstream":"<div><h2>New Features</h2><ul>\n<li>Conversion: Add support for reading images in the JPEG XL format</li>\n<li>Conversion: Add support for CSS Level 4 selectors</li>\n<li>Edit book: Check book: Add a check for dangling ARIA references and update ARIA references when auto fixing invalid ids</li>\n<li>MOBI/AZW3/PDB Output: Speed up compression, making conversion to these formats faster</li>\n<li>Content server/E-book viewer: Honor the prefers-reduced-motion setting of the operating system</li>\n<li>Speed up adding books and starting calibre in large libraries with the Tag browser hidden</li>\n<li>Catalogs: Use calibre as the creator of generated catalogs and record the generation date as the publication date</li>\n<li>Create your own Adventure: Improve the character selection screen</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bug Fixes</h2><ul>\n<li>PDF Input: Fix a regression in the previous release that broke conversion of some PDF files</li>\n<li>EPUB 3 conversion: Fix a regression in the previous release that caused invalid navigation markup to be generated</li>\n<li>Fix a regression in the previous release that caused non-breaking spaces to be converted to regular spaces in comments and text columns</li>\n<li>PDF Output: Fix a blank page at the end of chapters in some multi column layouts</li>\n<li>Amazon and Google Images metadata sources: Get them working again using camoufox</li>\n<li>Various robustness and edge case improvements int he database backed around data files, notes and formats</li>\n<li>Fix various stale cached values for composite columns and searches after changing series, restoring formats from the trash and redefining saved searches</li>\n<li>Fix setting a custom series with the same series index sometimes not being saved</li>\n<li>Fix appending multiple values to custom columns</li>\n<li>Full text search: Fix searching in libraries without book files</li>\n<li>macOS: E-book viewer: Fix the viewer triggering the \"access data from other apps\" prompt for Google Chrome on macOS 27</li>\n<li>EPUB/MOBI catalog: Sort a series before longer series names that start with it</li>\n<li>EPUB/MOBI catalog: Fix an error when generating catalogs from the GUI with prefix rules</li>\n<li>ODT Input: Preserve restarted list numbering</li>\n<li>Kobo driver: Fix a regression in cover handling for older Tolino firmware and keep dots in filenames on Tolino devices</li>\n<li>Edit book: Fix the choose file dialog when importing books not being kept above the editor window</li>\n<li>calibredb list_categories: Fix output showing bytes representations</li>\n<li>Fix templates using {isbn} or {languages} more than once returning the wrong value</li>\n<li>Fix decoding of HTML entities that decode to more bytes than themselves</li>\n<li>Fix an error when cancelling a metadata download</li>\n<li>Content server: Fix full text search actions being applied to the default library instead of the library being viewed</li>\n<li>Content server: Fix various issues with showing books from the wrong library when switching between libraries</li>\n<li>Content server: Notify the calibre GUI of new formats created by conversions in the server</li>\n<li>Content server/E-book viewer: Various fixes for dark mode and keyboard focus styling</li>\n<li>Fix various hardcoded colors being unreadable in dark mode</li>\n</ul></div>","upstream_url":"https://calibre-ebook.com/download"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=Calibre","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","CUSTOM_PORT=8080","CUSTOM_HTTPS_PORT=8181","QTWEBENGINE_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1","NO_GAMEPAD=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-calibre/releases/tag/v9.17.0-ls6","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/files.arm64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/packages.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/packages.arm64.json.gz"},"run_json":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-calibre/releases/download/v9.17.0-ls6/run.json","logs_zip":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-calibre/releases/download/v9.17.0-ls6/logs.zip","test_report":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/site/images/calibre/builds/v9.17.0-ls6/","tests":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/calibre/bui